---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Split from '../components/Split.astro'

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL
---

<BaseLayout title="Community | Pine Lake Covenant Church">
  <div class="canvas">
    <Split
      class="to-full"
      filename="716230305_18207937204338056_7473215551578781003_n.jpg"
      alt="Members talking and laughing together in the sanctuary"
      tone="sand"
      reverse
      eyebrow="Community"
    >
      <h1 class="display">Community</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Pine Lake is more than a Sunday gathering. This page is for people who are beginning to make Pine Lake home, and
        want to see what shared life looks like here.
      </p>
    </Split>

    <Split
      class="to-full"
      filename="474748731_1030392515795404_2521947271930024728_n.jpg"
      alt="People connecting together in community at Pine Lake"
      tone="paper"
      eyebrow="Through the week"
      heading="Life together"
    >
      <p>
        Most of what makes Pine Lake feel like home happens outside of Sunday — a smaller group that meets through the
        week, a serving team, or the people who show up when a season turns hard.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Life Groups</strong> — small groups that meet regularly to build relationships, study Scripture, and grow
          together.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Serve &amp; Volunteer</strong> — opportunities to serve within the church and in the wider community.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </Split>

    <Split
      class="to-full"
      filename="716722551_18207937243338056_4731496310256514273_n.jpg"
      alt="Carrying groceries for the Issaquah & Sammamish food project"
      tone="sand"
      reverse
      eyebrow="Generosity"
      heading="Practicing generosity"
    >
      <p>
        Giving is one way we respond to God’s generosity toward us. It supports the mission and shared life of Pine
        Lake, and helps us care for our community, both locally and globally.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://plcc.churchcenter.com/giving">Learn more about giving at Pine Lake →</a>
      </p>
    </Split>

    <Split
      class="to-full"
      filename="476750093_18157384759338056_1921287384410502360_n.jpg"
      alt="A moment of care and prayer in community"
      tone="paper"
      eyebrow="You’re not alone"
      heading="Care & support"
    >
      <p>
        When life is difficult, the church is here to offer prayer, care, and practical support. You don’t have to walk
        alone.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href={`${base}for-our-neighbors/care-support/`}>See how we care for one another →</a>
      </p>
    </Split>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Getting started</h2>
      <p class="measure">
        If you are exploring Pine Lake for the first time,
        <a href={`${base}next-steps/`}>Next Steps</a> is usually the best place to begin.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
